        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Vanessa Kirby, Richard Curtis, Peter Morgan\n- Works: Great Expectations, About Time, The Crown\n- Organizations: BBC, Netflix, British Academy Television Awards\n- Roles: Estella, Joanna, Princess Margaret\n\nFacts:\n- In 2011, Vanessa Kirby starred as Estella in the BBC adaptation of Great Expectations.\n- About Time was released in the United Kingdom on 4 September 2013.\n- In 2013, Vanessa Kirby starred as Joanna in Richard Curtis' romantic comedy About Time.\n- Vanessa Kirby portrays Princess Margaret in Peter Morgan's Netflix series The Crown.\n- Vanessa Kirby was nominated for the British Academy Television Award for Best Supporting Actress for her role in The Crown.",
